# Paths excluded from `rafter secrets` (root-level, plain gitignore-style
# paths — the documented .rafter/.rafterignore form with `:Pattern Name`
# qualifiers is silently ignored by CLI v0.10.0).
#
# Everything below is a VERIFIED false positive. Re-verify before adding to
# this list — an entry here is a permanent hole in the CI backstop.

# Vendored upstream xterm.js: a 289KB single-line minified UMD bundle. The
# generic-api-key rule is an entropy check, and it matches the bundle's own
# internal `TwoKeyMap` class name. There is no credential in this file, and
# there cannot be one that we would recognise anyway — it is third-party build
# output, so a real finding here would mean a compromised dependency, which is
# a supply-chain question rather than a secret-scanning one.
internal/webui/assets/xterm.js
